lse,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:p002","text":"孫叔敖者，楚之處士也。虞丘相進之於楚莊王，以自代也。三月爲楚相，施教導民，上下和合，世俗盛美，政緩禁止，吏無姦邪，盜賊不起。秋冬則勸民山採，春夏以水，各得其所便，民皆樂其生。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m002-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孫叔敖","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m002-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"虞丘相","kind":"person","person_id":"q9v_ucd_uj4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m002-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"1kr_t55_e8m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m002-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m002-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m002-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"盜賊","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m002-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m002-0081","start":81,"end":82,"surface":"民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-119-xunli","book_id":"b-shiji-119","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji119-xunli"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:p003","text":"莊王以爲幣輕，更以小爲大，百姓不便，皆去其業。市令言之相曰：「市亂，民莫安其處，次行不定。」相曰：「如此幾何頃乎？」市令曰：「三月頃。」相曰：「罷，吾今令之復矣。」後五日，朝，相言之王曰：「前日更幣，以爲輕。今市令來言曰『市亂，民莫安其處，次行之不定』。臣請遂令復如故。」王許之，下令三日而市復如故。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"1kr_t55_e8m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"市令","kind":"person","person_id":"wir_j3b_dg1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"相","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"相","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"市令","kind":"person","person_id":"wir_j3b_dg1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"相","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"相","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0091","start":91,"end":92,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"1kr_t55_e8m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"市令","kind":"person","person_id":"wir_j3b_dg1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m003-0136","start":136,"end":137,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"1kr_t55_e8m","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-119-xunli","book_id":"b-shiji-119","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji119-xunli"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:p004","text":"楚民俗好庳車，王以爲庳車不便馬，欲下令使髙之。相曰：「令數下，民不知所從，不可。王必欲髙車，臣請教閭里使髙其梱。乘車者皆君子，君子不能數下車。」王許之。居半歳，民悉自髙其車。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m004-0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"1kr_t55_e8m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m004-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"相","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m004-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"1kr_t55_e8m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m004-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"君子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m004-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"君子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m004-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"1kr_t55_e8m","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-119-xunli","book_id":"b-shiji-119","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji119-xunli"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:p012","text":"太史公曰：孫叔敖出一言，郢市復。子産病死，鄭民號哭。公儀子見好布而家婦逐。石奢縱父而死，楚昭名立。李離過殺而伏劍，晉文以正國法。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m012-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"r7a_uaf_rry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m012-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"孫叔敖","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m012-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"子産","kind":"person","person_id":"p9x_9np_wva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m012-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"公儀子","kind":"person","person_id":"51f_m7q_nuu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m012-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"家婦","kind":"person","person_id":"v9v_sk2_lbn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m012-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"石奢","kind":"person","person_id":"ufr_eoj_xit_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m012-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"楚昭","kind":"person","person_id":"d1k_jtj_7sy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m012-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"李離","kind":"person","person_id":"r21_u44_q3d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-119-xunli:m012-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"晉文","kind":"person","person_id":"6r6_00u_xxf","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-119-xunli","book_id":"b-shiji-119","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji119-xunli"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p007","text":"楚相孫叔敖知其賢人也，善待之。病且死，屬其子曰：「我死，汝必貧困。若往見優孟，言我孫叔敖之子也。」居數年，其子窮困負薪，逢優孟，與言曰：「我，孫叔敖子也。父且死時，屬我貧困往見優孟。」優孟曰：「若無遠有所之。」即為孫叔敖衣冠，抵掌談語。歲餘，像孫叔敖，楚王及左右不能別也。莊王置酒，優孟前為壽。莊王大驚，以為孫叔敖復生也，欲以為相。優孟曰：「請歸與婦計之，三日而為相。」莊王許之。三日後，優孟復來。王曰：「婦言謂何？」孟曰：「婦言慎無為，楚相不足為也。如孫叔敖之為楚相，盡忠為廉以治楚，楚王得以霸。今死，其子無立錐之地，貧困負薪以自飲食。必如孫叔敖，不如自殺。」因歌曰：「山居耕田苦，難以得食。起而為吏，身貪鄙者餘財，不顧恥辱。身死家室富，又恐受賕枉法，為姦觸大罪，身死而家滅。貪吏安可為也！念為廉吏，奉法守職，竟死不敢為非。廉吏安可為也！楚相孫叔敖持廉至死，方今妻子窮困負薪而食，不足為也！」於是莊王謝優孟，乃召孫叔敖子，封之寢丘四百戶，以奉其祀。后十世不絕。此知可以言時矣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"孫叔敖","kind":"person","person_id":"n45_fw3_p09","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"其子","kind":"person","person_id":"n45_fw3_p09_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0041","start":41,"end":46,"surface":"孫叔敖之子","kind":"person","person_id":"n45_fw3_p09_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"其子","kind":"person","person_id":"n45_fw3_p09_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0071","start":71,"end":75,"surface":"孫叔敖子","kind":"person","person_id":"n45_fw3_p09_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-s